{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_13_level_main_13-15_beg",
  "groupId": "main_13",
  "stageId": "main_13-15",
  "title": "Someone Speak Your Mind",
  "storyCode": "13-17",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-15_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "76578c62fff42373fb39667eadf32711ce91cae04673734c4b7d328e0042968d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) The King of Sarkaz is dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) The King killed the King."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) Why? This should not be..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) Our city, Kazdel..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) This would be a curse! A curse engraved upon the crown..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sarkaz?",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(In ancient Sarkaz) This would be... the beginning of the end of all..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Tomorrow morning, the attack begins."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Siege and her Exemplars will be responsible for the perimeter. Us, the Rhodes rabbit and the Banshee have to get deep into that waystation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where's that old bitch Kal'tsit? She's sending us off on this suicide mission without making so much as a cameo appearance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Her injuries have not yet healed. Ascalon will look after her and the Doctor. They will stay behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Rhodes Island recently came under Confessarius attack, they were trying to take the bunny's crown."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmph, the crown."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hoederer... you didn't tell the Victorians the truth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If your plan works, and we go back to Kazdel, what are you gonna do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Even your new Victorian friends are probably not gonna be okay with you bundling 'war criminals' in with 'Sarkaz caught up in the war'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't tell me you vowed to bring the Sarkaz home but never thought through this little problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Like, are you gonna head off to teach a class on 'historical reflections' to this bunch of grunts dragged off the battlefield? In that Kazdel basement university?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe I'll start a literacy class there. Make sure future Sarkaz have fewer illiterates like W here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do my ears deceive me? Did Hoederer actually make a joke out of Ines's words? On such a serious topic?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What happened? Did sucking up to General Manfred teach you a little emotional intelligence?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmph..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'War's over, back to Kazdel.' Real funny, we're actually fantasizing about this stuff here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're mercs, and that's all we're ever gonna be."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're such a lovely Caprinae, Ines, maybe you could run off to Leithanien and become a governess for some hoity toity nobles in a big, tall tower."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You could teach... Let me think... how to keep your hair nice and silky in a war zone? How's that sound?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Not interested."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What are you daydreaming about? The battle's about to start."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No, I just..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I remember you said you wanted to open a shop in Kazdel."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Because I didn't have a place to fence stolen goods at the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Oh yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How about we use the first round of tuition from my literacy class for your startup capital?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I doubt that class is gonna earn you much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "On the other hand, kidnapping a Leithanian governess could fetch a decent ransom. Gotta be at least as much as ten merc heads."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's talk about it when we make it home for real."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Your mental state has me worrying if you can really handle this mission."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Did those illusions or the Arts Circles drive you mad?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Pay no attention to this mopey idiot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Time waits for no man. Once we stake the Vampire and behead Theresis, then you two can head on back to Kazdel and talk over all the interior decorating plans for your love nest."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Theresis."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've been thinking about this for a while, W. You may not like what I'm about to say, but I still have to say it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hah, throwing cold water on me before the fight?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Pretty much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We can't kill Theresis, at least not right here or now, it can't be the Sarkaz executing him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ines was right, those illusions did scramble your brains."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Killing him means no Kazdel."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Whether now or for a good long while after the war, he has to be recorded as the Regent... and even be praised by some."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you out of your mind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I really don't feel like joking about this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We still need to stop the war, and I haven't changed my mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But Theresis has taken his place as a cornerstone of the Sarkaz future."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Kazdel won't survive another split, and this war... it can't end with another Sarkaz betrayal, with another Sarkaz civil war."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Remember the plan I was talking about before? We need the Sarkaz here to pull out of Victoria before everyone hears about his death."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Once everyone knows the Sarkaz have failed, and the threat of Theresis is gone, what happens then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The dukes will slaughter every last Sarkaz in Victoria without mercy. The revenge killings will spread to other countries in centrum, and all civilization will have a justifiable excuse... to exterminate the Sarkaz."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They'll put together a coalition, just and reasonable, swift and decisive... to divide up all of Theresa's and Theresis's legacies."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can't you picture that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "To be honest, I don't give a shit about any consequences of Theresis dying. All I'm here for is the part where he dies."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Coalitions? Slaughtering Sarkaz? Weren't they doing that already?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Does Theresis dying mean all the devils are just gonna lose their will to fight back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hah, no way. I don't buy that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "He sent the assassins to kill Theresa, declared himself king, and dragged all of us into the mess we're in today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We don't need to sacrifice ourselves for his Kazdel, for his—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't think you can keep yourself out of it, W."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you think of yourself as nothing more than a merc?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How many people have you brought? From Reunion to where we stand now, how many Sarkaz have you gathered?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're carrying their lives on your shoulders."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't fucking care!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You have to care."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You think you can just keep on killing people, keep on burying bombs in the dirt?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You're leading those Sarkaz now. You have to think about how to deal with their hopes and dreams."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You have to think through what their lives mean to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's not just Theresis—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ines",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't forget, there's Theresa too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So, from all perspectives we're... all we can be is their successors, the inheritors of their ideals."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The two of them, they're the reason the Sarkaz could come together in the first place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's not the real Theresa."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's a fake Theresis has cooked up. He can't fool me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "W."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Look at yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Who do you think you are—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You couldn't accept Theresa's death, you're stuck in the shadow of Babel."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Like..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Shut up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoederer",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You think Amiya's walking ahead of you. You think she's Theresa's handpicked successor, that the King of Sarkaz should be thinking about this stuff."
